a damn millionaire?!

5
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:13,388
This has to be fake.

6
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,807
You two are putting on a show for us.

7
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:21,646
So the Eagles want to bring back a fired coach?

8
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:24,315
Let me guess...

9
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:27,110
Your team's 
performance sucked.

10
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,570
You fumbled 
all the tactics,

11
00:00:28,570 --> 00:00:29,821
and now you want
Ted to come

12
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:31,031
and save your ass, right?

13
00:00:31,031 --> 00:00:31,823
Bullshit.

14
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:35,326
You only got a few tricks from me.

15
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,079
Only a shit team
like yours

16
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,789
would treat him like he's some kind of genius.

17
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:42,709
Judging by your 
recent record,

18
00:00:42,709 --> 00:00:44,794
looks like our shit team

19
00:00:44,794 --> 00:00:47,213
could wipe the floor 
with you.

20
00:00:47,630 --> 00:00:49,049
With ease, bitch!

21
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,177
Just wait, Ted.

22
00:00:52,969 --> 00:00:54,095
When I beat you,

23
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:57,098
even if you come 
crawling back,

24
00:00:57,974 --> 00:00:59,184
I'll slam the door 
in your face!

25
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:00,226
Hey,

26
00:01:01,603 --> 00:01:03,438
the Knights will 
never lose to you.

27
00:01:11,654 --> 00:01:12,697
Eagle!

28
00:01:12,697 --> 00:01:14,699
The Knights, who once sat dead last 

29
00:01:14,699 --> 00:01:16,993
in the league, have made a miracle run

30
00:01:16,993 --> 00:01:18,661
all the way to 
the semifinals.

31
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:22,791
But today, they face the powerhouse Eagles.

32
00:01:22,874 --> 00:01:24,375
Will this be the end of their story?

33
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:27,128
Let's stay tuned for a fantastic game to come.

34
00:01:27,378 --> 00:01:28,296
Eagle!

35
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:29,964
Fight!

36
00:01:30,048 --> 00:01:32,383
Knights!

37
00:01:32,425 --> 00:01:33,551
Okay, boys, come on.

38
00:01:33,551 --> 00:01:34,844
Take a knee.

39
00:01:34,844 --> 00:01:35,512
Listen up!

40
00:01:36,262 --> 00:01:38,139
I know that team over there is strong. Alright?

41
00:01:38,598 --> 00:01:40,767
No one expects us to win.

42
00:01:41,142 --> 00:01:42,268
Now, I promise you...

43
00:01:43,061 --> 00:01:46,648
This team will go down
if we run my plays.

44
00:01:46,815 --> 00:01:48,942
We will walk out of here with a win.

45
00:01:49,109 --> 00:01:50,485
I can promise you that.

46
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:51,444
Yes, sir.

47
00:01:51,861 --> 00:01:52,529
Coach,

48
00:01:52,821 --> 00:01:53,905
we trust you completely.

49
00:01:54,906 --> 00:01:56,407
Alright, fellas,
let's go get this win.

50
00:01:56,407 --> 00:01:57,659
Alright, boys, bring it in.

51
00:01:57,826 --> 00:01:58,576
Hands in the middle.

52
00:01:58,576 --> 00:01:59,953
Barton, swing's on you.

53
00:02:00,453 --> 00:02:01,704
Alright, one on three, 
one on me.

54
00:02:01,704 --> 00:02:03,123
One, two, three. Win!

55
00:02:03,123 --> 00:02:04,958
Let's go, boys! Let's go!

56
00:02:09,003 --> 00:02:11,339
Ted, I know you're gonna work miracles for me.

57
00:02:12,715 --> 00:02:14,134
The beer is just not 

58
00:02:14,134 --> 00:02:16,553
suitable for a 
game of this caliber.

59
00:02:17,053 --> 00:02:17,762
It's for poor people.

60
00:02:18,054 --> 00:02:18,930
People of class.

61
00:02:20,181 --> 00:02:21,808
Like... like us.

62
00:02:22,350 --> 00:02:23,518
Need whiskey or...

63
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:24,644
wine.

64
00:02:25,436 --> 00:02:26,938
West, how confident are you in this game?

65
00:02:27,856 --> 00:02:29,732
I got a bowl of money riding on us.

66
00:02:29,732 --> 00:02:30,483
I need a win.

67
00:02:30,942 --> 00:02:31,734
Relax.

68
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:33,653
This is a sure win.

69
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:35,530
I will make sure you get your money.

70
00:02:36,114 --> 00:02:37,407
Their team's 
combined worth

71
00:02:37,407 --> 00:02:38,658
is thirty million dollars.

72
00:02:38,658 --> 00:02:39,701
This guy right here?

73
00:02:40,577 --> 00:02:41,286
Forty million.

74
00:02:41,953 --> 00:02:43,204
How are they supposed to compete with that?

75
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,622
Well,

76
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:47,083
as you know, I don't give a fuck about football.

77
00:02:48,334 --> 00:02:49,711
But I do care 
about winning.

78
00:02:50,628 --> 00:02:52,589
I'm counting on you to get this across the line.

79
00:02:54,007 --> 00:02:54,883
To victory.

80
00:02:57,051 --> 00:02:58,928
Celebrating way 
too soon, coach.

81
00:02:59,304 --> 00:02:59,971
Get him!

82
00:03:03,099 --> 00:03:03,933
Block up!

83
00:03:04,267 --> 00:03:06,102
Come on, block! 
Push through!

84
00:03:06,477 --> 00:03:07,228
Block!

85
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:09,230
There we go! 
Good, good!

86
00:03:15,028 --> 00:03:16,029
Touchdown!

87
00:03:16,779 --> 00:03:17,697
Right from the start,

88
00:03:17,697 --> 00:03:19,949
the Knights are off to a blazing start.

89
00:03:20,241 --> 00:03:22,535
Scott drives it home for the first touchdown!

90
00:03:23,203 --> 00:03:24,746
What the fuck 
is happening?
